  {
   "id": "judgment-281562@1.10",
   "gameId": "judgment-281562",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.10",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-02T03:05:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you for playing and reporting issues. Here’s a list of fixes in this update:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Updated to FSR 2.1.2 for improving quality",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• FSR 2.1 option has been adjusted and added as a Customizable option to Anti-Alias settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Updated to XeSS 1.0.1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "• Addressed an issue where V-Sync does not function correctly, causing the game to go too fast.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Addressed an issue where a portion of the upscaler was not working correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Improvements to stability during startup and play.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Addressed an issue where Street names on the map become difficult to read when the upscaler is active.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, we added functionality to hide the skip button during subtitled dialog.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To make this change in your graphics.ini file, please use the following steps:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Open a file explorer.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Add the following URL to the address bar: %appdata%\\SEGA\\Judgment\\Steam",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Right-click on graphics.ini and select \"Open with\" > \"Notepad\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Look for \"hide_skip_prompt_in_dialogues=0\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Change the \"0\" to 1.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Save the changes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
